### Create Branch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pine Drink Nguyen Hue",
  "address": "86 Nguyen Hue, Ben Nghe, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "email": "nguyenhue@pinedrink.vn",
  "latitude": 10.7756587,
  "longitude": 106.7004238,
  "timezone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh",
  "supportsPickup": true,
  "supportsDelivery": true,
  "averagePreparationMinutes": 15,
  "brandId": "{{brandId}}"
}

###

### Get Branch By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Branches By Brand
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/branches/brand/{{brandId}}?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Active Branches By Brand
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/branches/brand/{{brandId}}/active?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update Branch
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pine Drink Nguyen Hue Updated",
  "address": "88 Nguyen Hue, Ben Nghe, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City",
  "phone": "0907654321",
  "email": "nguyenhue.updated@pinedrink.vn",
  "latitude": 10.7760000,
  "longitude": 106.7010000,
  "timezone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh",
  "supportsPickup": true,
  "supportsDelivery": false,
  "averagePreparationMinutes": 20
}

###

### Delete Branch Soft
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
